*================================================================*
* CA Gen Encyclopedia - Views Definition
* Subject : CANDIDATE entity views
*================================================================*

*----------------------------------------------------------------*
* VIEW: VCANDIDATE-ALL
* Desc : Full view of candidate - used in maintenance screens
*----------------------------------------------------------------*
VIEW: VCANDIDATE-ALL OF CANDIDATE
  CANDIDATE-ID
  FIRST-NAME
  LAST-NAME
  DATE-OF-BIRTH
  ID-NUMBER
  ADDRESS-LINE-1
  ADDRESS-LINE-2
  CITY
  STATE-PROVINCE
  POSTAL-CODE
  COUNTRY
  PHONE-NUMBER
  EMAIL-ADDRESS
  CREATED-DATE
  RECORD-STATUS

*----------------------------------------------------------------*
* VIEW: VCANDIDATE-SUMMARY
* Desc : Summary view for lookup/display on other screens
*----------------------------------------------------------------*
VIEW: VCANDIDATE-SUMMARY OF CANDIDATE
  CANDIDATE-ID
  FIRST-NAME
  LAST-NAME
  DATE-OF-BIRTH
  ID-NUMBER
  PHONE-NUMBER
  EMAIL-ADDRESS
  RECORD-STATUS

*----------------------------------------------------------------*
* VIEW: VCANDIDATE-ID-LOOKUP
* Desc : Used to look up candidate by national ID number
*----------------------------------------------------------------*
VIEW: VCANDIDATE-ID-LOOKUP OF CANDIDATE
  CANDIDATE-ID
  ID-NUMBER
  FIRST-NAME
  LAST-NAME
  DATE-OF-BIRTH
  RECORD-STATUS

*----------------------------------------------------------------*
* VIEW: VCANDIDATE-ELIGIBILITY
* Desc : Minimal view used during eligibility check
*----------------------------------------------------------------*
VIEW: VCANDIDATE-ELIGIBILITY OF CANDIDATE
  CANDIDATE-ID
  DATE-OF-BIRTH
  RECORD-STATUS
